            "repere": "Paragraphe · Dinowax® Qwik is a hybrid ceramic micro-",
            "text": "Dinowax® Qwik is a hybrid ceramic micro-emulsion that is spray applied directly to clean or lightly soiled paint surfaces. Simply spray and wipe for incredible shine, gloss, paint color enhancement and water repellent beading effects.&nbsp;<br>Qwik produces a noticeably darker, enhanced shade to the paint surface. &nbsp;Instantaneously reversing years of UV oxidation. &nbsp;Not just a temporary surface treatment, Qwik is formulated with a proprietary reactive hybrid ceramic micro-emulsion technology that will last through multiple wash cycles. &nbsp;Apply universally, to paint, chrome and glass. &nbsp;Wipe clean to a streak-free, water repellent shine.&nbsp;&nbsp;",
